OL,3,GNEWSACollapsing road could permanently
OL,4,Ashut
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road which has been closed for more
OL,7,Fthan three years could be permanently
OL,8,Fshut, a council has said.
OL,10,FThe C31 into Hamsterley, near Bishop
OL,11,FAuckland, was fenced off after part of
OL,12,Fthe surface collapsed into the River
OL,13,FWear in January 2023, leading to road
OL,14,Fdiversions.
OL,16,FDurham County Council's cabinet will be
OL,17,Fasked to agree to the submission of an
OL,18,Fapplication to magistrates to formally
OL,19,Fclose the road after the local
OL,20,Fauthority said repairs were expected to
OL,21,Fexceed #10m.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
