OL,3,GNEWSACollapsing road could permanently
OL,4,Ashut
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is proposed the current diversionary
OL,7,Froute is made permanent as there are
OL,8,F"no guarantees" the road would not
OL,9,Fcollapse further. The Reform cabinet
OL,10,Fwill meet on 15 September.
